doctype html
html(lang="en")
    head
        meta(charset="UTF-8")
        meta(name="viewport", content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
        link(rel="stylesheet", href="style.css")
        title Document
        link(rel="stylesheet", href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Raleway:ital,wght@0,100..900;1,100..900&display=swap")
        link(rel="stylesheet", href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:ital,wght@0,100..900;1,100..900&display=swap")
    body
        .container
            header
                .logo Brella
                .nav 
                    a(href="#") Our Plan
                    a(href="#") Employers    
                    a(href="#") Brokers
                    a(href="#") Members
                    a(href="#") Blog
                button.btn Request a demo
                .lang 
                    a(href="#") Login
                    a(href="#") EN
            .main
                .title 
                    h1 Give your team peace of mind with supplemental health insurance from Brella.
                    p.subtitle I'm wondering...
                    .mainsearch
                        input.search.inp(type="text" placeholder="      how Brella's plan works")
                        button.search.btn1 Find out
        
            .imgdiv
                img.img1(src="./c.png", alt="")

            .section 
                .content
                    .left
                        p.tag WHY BRELLA?
                        h1 Today, any health insurance deductible can feel like a high deductible.
                        p.desc Brella's supplemental health plan enhances your health benefit strategy to ensure that health hardships don't become financial burdens.
                        p.link See our plan

                    .right
                        img(src="./d.png", alt="")
            .grid 
                .col-1
                    p.tag BRELLA BRINGS
                    .info 
                        h1 Customizable benefits
                        p Paperless install and admin
                        p Effortless enrollment
                        p Easy claims experience
                        p Fast benefit payouts
                        p Concierge support
                .col-2
                    .info 
                        p Every Brella plan comes with a benefit for Moderate, Severe, and Catastrophic conditions. Employees can select the payout amounts that fit their needs and their budget.
                        p Employers can fund part or all of the premiums—or offer Brella as a voluntary benefit. The choice is up to you.